/-! ## Frozen expected types for the transport boundary

The preceding `#check` commands are an inventory.  The assertions below are
the acceptance checks: they elaborate only if the checker, packed argument
order, hypotheses, conclusion, and internal quantifier closure retain the
displayed forms.  The two `Has...` assertions unfold specifications; they do
not provide inhabitants.
-/

open Encodable FFL FFL.FirstOrder FFL.FirstOrder.Arithmetic
open FFL.Entailment Metamath.Feferman
